            <div xml:id="d113">

                <pb facs="0194" n="186" sameAs="frus:frus1941v04/pg186"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/12258</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by Mr. Lauchlin Currie, Administrative
                        Assistant to President Roosevelt, for the President</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-05-13">May 13, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The attached cable from Chiang Kai-shek, addressed to me, arrived yesterday. I
                    think the source of his information was the Chinese Ambassador at Berlin, via
                    Dr. Quo Tai Chi.</p>
                <p>I am forwarding a copy to Secretary Hull.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lauchlin Currie</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d113-a1.xml" xpointer="d113-a1"/>
